                {"question": "What should a professional comparative analysis conclude with?", "options": ["A raw data table with no interpretation", "A clear, evidence-based view on which company is stronger and why", "A list of every number found in research", "No conclusion, only data"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Analysts are expected to form and defend a clear conclusion, not just present raw data."},
