                {"question": "Why is finance memo writing structured differently from a typical academic essay?", "options": ["There is no real difference", "Busy readers need the conclusion first; academic essays typically build toward a conclusion at the end", "Academic essays are not allowed to have conclusions", "Memos never contain supporting evidence"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Time-constrained financial decision-makers need the bottom line first, unlike the academic build-up-to-conclusion format."},
