                {"question": "Why is a finished, realistic financial model considered a strong differentiator in the Nigerian finance job market?", "options": ["It is required by law to apply for finance jobs", "Many candidates have coursework but few have a completed, realistic work sample to show", "Models are never reviewed by employers", "It replaces the need for any interview"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "A genuine finished project stands out because most applicants can only point to coursework, not a real work sample."},
