                {"question": "What is required before building the DCF and comps layer, according to today's lesson?", "options": ["Nothing, valuation can be built independently of the 3-statement model", "A completed, balanced 3-statement model from Day 27", "A finished investment memo", "Only the comps table, DCF is optional"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "The valuation work today builds directly on the completed and balanced 3-statement model from the prior day."},
                {"question": "What does the sensitivity table added today ultimately show?", "options": ["A single fixed valuation number", "How implied value changes across a range of discount rate and growth rate combinations", "Only historical revenue", "The company's stock ticker symbol"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "The two-variable sensitivity table displays a grid of implied values across varying key assumptions."}
